%% Pattern transverse : Lock ordering pour 100+ agents concurrents
%% Source : CLAUDE.md « Lock Ordering — Bundle / Field Payment »
%% Référence code : packages/backend/app/modules/inspections/services/collection_service.py
%% Plan : .claude/plans/INSPECTION_BUNDLE_P1_DETAIL.md

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant A1 as 👮 Agent A<br/>(terrain)
    participant A2 as 👮 Agent B<br/>(terrain)
    participant API as 🚦 FastAPI
    participant TX as 🔄 Transaction<br/>asyncpg
    participant CL as 🗄️ commercial_licenses
    participant SR as 🗄️ service_requests
    participant LO as 🗄️ license_obligations
    participant SP as 🗄️ service_payments
    participant EB as 📡 EventBus
    participant AL as 📜 audit_logs

    Note over A1,AL: Scénario : 2 agents tentent de collecter le paiement<br/>de la MÊME commercial_license simultanément

    %% Agent A initie
    A1->>API: POST /inspections/collect-field-payment<br/>(license_id=42, amount=350000)
    API->>TX: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    TX->>TX: SET LOCAL lock_timeout = '3s'
    TX->>TX: SET LOCAL statement_timeout = '5s'

    Note over TX: 🔒 LOCK 1 — ROOT lock<br/>(seul lock explicite)
    TX->>CL: SELECT * FROM commercial_licenses<br/>WHERE id = 42 FOR UPDATE
    CL-->>TX: ✅ Lock acquis par A

    %% Agent B essaie en parallèle
    A2->>API: POST /inspections/collect-field-payment<br/>(license_id=42, amount=350000)
    API->>TX: BEGIN TRANSACTION (B)
    Note over TX: SET LOCAL lock_timeout = '3s'
    TX->>CL: SELECT * FROM commercial_licenses<br/>WHERE id = 42 FOR UPDATE
    Note over CL: ⏳ Agent B attend...<br/>(lock détenu par A)

    %% Agent A continue
    Note over TX: 🔒 LOCK 2 — INSERT optimistic
    TX->>SR: INSERT INTO service_requests<br/>(commercial_license_id=42, ...)
    Note over SR: Partial UNIQUE index<br/>idx_sr_commercial_license_unique<br/>(pas de FOR UPDATE)
    SR-->>TX: ✅ INSERT OK (id=789)

    Note over TX: 🔒 LOCK 3 — UPDATE batch
    TX->>LO: UPDATE license_obligations<br/>SET status='payment_pending'<br/>WHERE license_id=42 AND status='due'
    LO-->>TX: ✅ 5 obligations lockées + updated

    Note over TX: 🔒 LOCK 4 — INSERT final
    TX->>SP: INSERT INTO service_payments<br/>(service_request_id=789, ...)<br/>workflow_status='field_collected'
    SP-->>TX: ✅ INSERT OK (id=1234)

    TX->>TX: COMMIT
    TX->>API: ✅ Transaction A committed
    API->>A1: 200 OK + receipt PDF
    Note over TX: 🔓 Locks libérés

    %% Effets post-transaction
    par Audit + EventBus (fire-and-forget)
        API->>AL: INSERT audit_logs<br/>(PAYMENT_VALIDATED, agent_id=A)
        API->>EB: publish(payment.collected)<br/>asyncio.create_task
        EB-->>API: routing ministères + notifications
    end

    %% Agent B reprend
    Note over CL: Agent B reçoit le lock<br/>(libéré par A)
    CL-->>TX: ✅ Lock acquis par B

    %% Agent B essaie INSERT service_requests
    TX->>SR: INSERT INTO service_requests<br/>(commercial_license_id=42, ...)
    Note over SR: ❌ UniqueViolationError<br/>idx_sr_commercial_license_unique
    SR-->>TX: 23505 unique_violation

    %% Recovery déterministe (PAS de retry/backoff)
    Note over TX,SR: Recovery pattern :<br/>try/except UniqueViolationError
    TX->>SR: SELECT id FROM service_requests<br/>WHERE commercial_license_id = 42<br/>LIMIT 1
    SR-->>TX: id=789 (existant créé par A)

    Note over TX: 🔒 LOCK 3 — UPDATE batch (B retry)
    TX->>LO: UPDATE license_obligations<br/>SET status='payment_pending'<br/>WHERE license_id=42 AND status='due'
    LO-->>TX: ✅ 0 rows (déjà updated par A)

    TX->>TX: Check : 0 obligations updated
    TX->>TX: ROLLBACK ou COMMIT (idempotent)
    TX->>API: ⚠️ Already collected by A
    API->>A2: 409 Conflict<br/>"Payment already collected"

    Note over A1,AL: ✅ Aucune race condition<br/>✅ Aucun double paiement<br/>✅ Lock libéré rapidement (lock_timeout=3s)<br/>✅ Recovery déterministe sans retry/backoff
